# Test Generator SaaS — MVP Context

Cloud multi-tenant SaaS for schools/academies/colleges/universities. Teachers generate professional test papers; Super Admin manages the system. Each organization's data is fully isolated.

## Roles

- **Super Admin**: orgs (CRUD, activate/deactivate), subscription plans, global question bank, approve teacher suggestions, boards/classes/subjects/chapters/topics, system settings
- **Org Admin**: teachers (CRUD, activate/deactivate), test schedules, org tests, org profile/branding
- **Teacher**: assigned schedules, auto/manual test generation, suggest questions, edit/export own tests

## Education hierarchy

`Board → Class → Subject → Chapter → Topic → Question` — each question links to exactly one topic.

## Question bank

Single **global** bank. Only Super Admin add/update/delete/approve. Teachers **suggest** only; approved suggestions enter the bank. V1 types: MCQ (4 options + correct), Short, Long.

## Test generation

- Chapter select → topics auto-selected; teacher may refine
- Modes: Auto (balanced or random) | Manual
- Balanced (default): one question per topic per round
- Post-generate edit: replace/remove/add/reorder
- Schedule flow: subject + exam date locked; schedule name → Test Type

## Schedules & reminders

Org Admin creates named schedules (board → classes → subjects → dates → teachers). Teachers create papers from assignments. Day-before email reminders when SMTP is configured. Deleting teacher/schedule must **keep** generated papers.

## Visibility & export

Teacher = own papers; Org Admin = org papers; Super Admin = all. Export via Print/PDF (org logo, header fields, marks, time, instructions).

## Out of MVP (V2+)

Student portal, online exams, billing, advanced analytics, audit logs, Excel import/export, AI-generated questions, Word export polish.
